cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use confound-controls in your work, please cite it as below."
title: confound-controls
abstract: >-
  Confound-matched controls for classifier claims: for each named confound,
  restrict the negatives to a subset matched 1:1 to the positives on that
  confound and recompute AUROC with bootstrap intervals, anchored to the
  uncontrolled baseline; refuses to issue a verdict when the matched control
  is vacuous.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arnold
    given-names: Jaret
repository-code: "https://github.com/musharna/confound-controls"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/confound-controls/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
keywords:
  - confounding
  - matching
  - AUROC
  - classifier-evaluation
